I collapsed the profile/index validation into one likely-success branch and added branch-prediction hints, keeping the cached-type fast path unchanged so the common case stays a single compare and return.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    if (__builtin_expect(type != FIT_UINT8_INVALID, 1))
        return type;

    if (__builtin_expect(profile != NULL && profileIndex < profile->numFields, 1))
        return profile->fields[profileIndex].type;

    return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;
}
```